{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "NUM",
 "chapter": 14,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.1",
   "range": "NUM.14.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6204b834",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.1#p1-6204b834",
     "text": "Those who were afraid at the report of the ten spies.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "people wept that night"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.3",
   "range": "NUM.14.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b0056de7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.3#p1-b0056de7",
     "text": "To our enemies the Canaanites.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "a prey"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.5",
   "range": "NUM.14.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ae48a9d3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.5#p1-ae48a9d3",
     "text": "Lamenting the people, and praying for them.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "fell on their faces before all"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.6",
   "range": "NUM.14.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "287e651d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.6#p1-287e651d",
     "text": "For sorrow, hearing their blasphemy.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "rent their clothes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.9",
   "range": "NUM.14.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8a3e66f6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.9#p1-8a3e66f6",
     "text": "We shall easily overcome them.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "bread for us"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.10",
   "range": "NUM.14.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a8268ed3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.10#p1-a8268ed3",
     "text": "This is the condition of those who would persuade in God's cause, to be persecuted by the multitude.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "stone them with stones"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.15",
   "range": "NUM.14.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cf216773",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.15#p1-cf216773",
     "text": "So that none shall escape.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "one man"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.20",
   "range": "NUM.14.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cd1469f9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.20#p1-cd1469f9",
     "text": "In that he did not utterly destroy them, but allowed their children and certain others to enter.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "according to thy word"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.22",
   "range": "NUM.14.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "14753da2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.22#p1-14753da2",
     "text": "That is, various times and often.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "ten times"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.24",
   "range": "NUM.14.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "957addc1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.24#p1-957addc1",
     "text": "A meek and obedient spirit, and not rebellious.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "spirit with him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.25",
   "range": "NUM.14.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "02f53bb0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.25#p1-c084ab68",
     "text": "And lie in wait for you.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "dwelt in the valley"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.25#p2-3fe23d37",
     "text": "For I will not defend you.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "wilderness by the way of the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.33",
   "range": "NUM.14.33",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2cd4c6a5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.33#p1-b9e786de",
     "text": "The word signifies to be shepherds, or to wander like shepherds to and fro.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "wander in the wilderness forty years"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.33#p2-cc3cf9a5",
     "text": "Your infidelity and disobedience against God.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "whoredoms"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.34",
   "range": "NUM.14.34",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c5ed4784",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.34#p1-c5ed4784",
     "text": "Whether my promise is true or not.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "shall know my breach of promise"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.40",
   "range": "NUM.14.40",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9607896e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.40#p1-9607896e",
     "text": "They confessed their sin in rebelling against God, but did not consider their offence in going up without God's commandment.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "sinned"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.14.44",
   "range": "NUM.14.44",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d3666bb6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.14.44#p1-d3666bb6",
     "text": "They could not be stayed by any means.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "presumed to go up unto the"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
